{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artificial Extinction 2 \u2013 Demo</strong> offers a hands-on preview of the full game's unique blend of <strong>first-person shooter</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong> \u2014 created over 4 years by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1754059771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a sentient AI defending a base on a post-human Earth, fighting off waves of deadly machine enemies. Seamlessly switch between <strong>boots-on-the-ground FPS combat</strong> and <strong>RTS command mode</strong> to build, upgrade, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.poster.avif?t=1754059771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.webm?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/d26dd476054a2f46f9d70194bf45399a.mp4?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's Included in the Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Full Tutorial</strong> \u2013 Learn core systems including building, mining, turret placement, and tactical switching between FPS and RTS.<br>\u2022 <strong>1 Complete Campaign Level</strong> \u2013 Play a full mission from the main game with dynamic enemy attacks and randomized resource placement.<br>\u2022 <strong>Test Range (Sandbox Mode)</strong> \u2013 Spawn enemies, test every turret type, and freely explore strategies in a safe environment.<br>\u2022 <strong>Unlockable Modes</strong> \u2013 Beat the campaign level to unlock:<br>\u2003\u2022 <strong>Nightmare Mode</strong> \u2013 A brutal challenge with faster, tougher enemies<br>\u2003\u2022 <strong>FPS-Only Mode</strong> \u2013 No base-building, just direct combat<br>\u2003\u2022 <strong>RTS-Only Mode</strong> \u2013 Control the battlefield without firing a shot<br>\u2022 <strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete globally with demo-exclusive leaderboards that track your <strong>score</strong> and <strong>survival time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1754059771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Why Play the Demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're testing the hybrid gameplay, mastering turret tactics, or just want to try out Nightmare Mode, this demo offers a <strong>replayable</strong>, <strong>challenging</strong>, and <strong>content-rich slice</strong> of <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like tactical base defense, fast FPS combat, and strategic survival \u2014 this is your chance to try the experience for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860660?t=1754059771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/a6ce55f144bc7fe689a9904d8801db665aeb36e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754059771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/9ff77e2e4e3c774f031a05bdb61d8e50b0583627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754059771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/9ff77e2e4e3c774f031a05bdb61d8e50b0583627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754059771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Artificial Extinction 2 \u2013 Demo</strong> offers a hands-on preview of the full game's unique blend of <strong>first-person shooter</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>tower defense</strong> \u2014 created over 4 years by a solo developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.poster.avif?t=1754059771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.webm?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cc7bd3b0e7f0efbc5398913887d9335.mp4?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"