rvival time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.poster.avif?t=1754059771\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.webm?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/extras/7cacad636cbe8835d31baa3d3399f67e.mp4?t=1754059771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Why Play the Demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're testing the hybrid gameplay, mastering turret tactics, or just want to try out Nightmare Mode, this demo offers a <strong>replayable</strong>, <strong>challenging</strong>, and <strong>content-rich slice</strong> of <i>Artificial Extinction 2</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like tactical base defense, fast FPS combat, and strategic survival \u2014 this is your chance to try the experience for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["100Hr Games Inc"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1570450","name":"Artificial Extinction 2"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860660/91a7800405836a93999d2d225f0dc6ee3ff1a231/header.jpg?t=1754059771","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176472,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176472/movie480.mp4?t=1754013640","max":"htt